{"type": "assistant", "message": {"id": "msg_1785743430999", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "非常有价值的发现。关键的前期工作：\n- **DualCodec** (2505.13000)：低帧率、语义增强的编解码器\n- **LFVC** (2409.12117)：用于快速语音 LLM 的低帧率语音编解码器\n- **SALAD** (2410.16048)：基于连续特征的 TTS，使用基于 token 的潜变量扩散\n- **DiTAR**：用于语音生成的扩散 Transformer AR\n- **CLEAR** (2508.19098)：连续 AR，在 LibriSpeech 上达到 SOTA，WER 为 1.88%\n- **\"Continuous AR Models with Noise Augmentation Avoid Error Accumulation\"** (2411.18447) —— 直接解决了误差累积问题！\n\n让我查阅一下这篇论文，并获取 CLEAR / DualCodec 的详细信息。"}], "model": "GLM-5.2-w4a8", "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 0, "output_tokens": 0, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 0, "cache_read_input_tokens": 0}, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "session_id": "058a4cad-00f1-423a-87d6-78b4fbfd35a6", "uuid": "be11ee28-7f87-4e62-9b7d-22956d6db894"}
